    description: "Per ADR-0027 §\"Open questions\" #4 and ADR-0024 §\"Fold-residue discipline\" rule 3 (recurrence-promotion threshold).\n\nPhase 1 of ADR-0027 implicitly establishes meta['framework_role'] as a recognized convention (the Cluster D fold target). Once a second meta key promotion candidate is identified — e.g., a future Phase 3 audit-findings doc proposes a new meta key, or ADR-0028's Edge.evidence_type fold introduces meta['resolution_quality'] — the recurrence-promotion threshold fires and a parallel axis_meta_keys.py registry should be established.\n\nDefer until the second candidate appears; until then, file as P4 backlog. The registry shape mirrors edge_types.py / symbol_kinds.py: Final[tuple[MetaKeySpec, ...]] with name, axis, description.\n\nReference: docs/adr/0027-symbol-kind-language-construct-only.md §\"Open questions\" #4; docs/adr/0024-axis-declaration-template.md §\"Fold-residue discipline\" rule 3."  # 78ef
